  "reviews": {
    "title": "What Locals Say",
    "subtitle": "Real reviews from our wonderful customers.",
    "review_list": [
      {
        "name": "Ghenwa Olabi",
        "text": "Honestly, the place is amazing and very nice. The staff is super sweet, and the location is easy to reach — not far like everyone says. The atmosphere is beautiful and comfortable. Nothing they offer is bad, and their prices aren’t overpriced like I heard. They also have games, and the staff keeps the vibe fun — they don’t let anyone sit bored, and they help you have a great time. 🥰♥️"
      },
      {
        "name": "Walaa Aly",
        "text": "♥️ It's a really cozy and lovely café! The atmosphere is calm, the staff are friendly, and the drinks are delicious. It’s the perfect place to relax, study, or spend time with friends. Highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "name": "Mohamed Yassin",
        "text": "A very elegant place offering high-quality beverages and desserts, with exceptionally friendly staff"
      }
    ]
